// SFX — Player join (roster gains a player: lobby + late join)
// Status: DONE (owner-approved 2026-07-19)
// Warm two-note e-piano "hello", rising F4 -> C5. E-piano is M2's lobby voice — joins happen
// in the lobby, so the sound speaks the room's language. Mirror of sfx-player-leave.
// Render: one hit, WAV. Audition plays once per second.
// Paste into https://strudel.cc — spec: TDD/sound/stinger-sfx-spec.md

setcpm(60)

note("[f4 c5@2] ~ ~ ~").sound("gm_epiano1")
  .attack(.005).decay(.25).sustain(0).release(.15)
  .lpf(2800).room(.15).size(2)
  .gain(.4)
